    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to view the sample page and the editorial plan for its text.\r\n- Read the 'Editorial Plan for Page Words' to understand the desired tone and message.\r\n- Use the 'Prompt Dial' controls to switch between different versions of the AI-generated text.\r\n- Compare the AI-generated text with the details in the editorial plan.\r\n- Identify which parts of the words match your plan and which do not.\r\n- Decide whether to 'Keep' the text, 'Redirect' the AI with a new prompt, or 'Rewrite' a small part yourself.",
